&lt;li&gt;Automate security workflows and build detection logic to improve alert fidelity, operational efficiency, and coverage across the environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish change control processes, security baselines, and security awareness training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
