&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced IT Infrastructure Engineer to design and maintain the cloud and on-premise infrastructure supporting advanced defense technology systems. This role owns IT operations — automation, virtualization, data platform, and disaster recovery — and partners closely with our Security function on SIEM, NIST 800-171 compliance, and incident response. The ideal candidate has expertise in Microsoft 365 / Azure / AWS architecture, deep PowerShell automation chops, and is excited about building infrastructure at a fast-moving defense tech company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement secure cloud infrastructure using Microsoft 365, Azure, and AWS to support defense technology platforms and mission-critical operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Security Lead on SIEM operations, NIST 800-171 compliance evidence, and security tooling integration — implementing the IT-side controls and log/data pipelines that Security relies on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain monitoring and alerting solutions to ensure system health, visibility, and rapid response to outages and performance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage system patching and updates using endpoint and infrastructure management tools, ensuring systems remain secure and up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor infrastructure and services, responding to alerts and performance degradation to maintain high availability and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advanced L3/L4 technical support for bare metal servers, Linux environments, and mission-critical infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and support SQL Server environments, including performance tuning, maintenance plans, and access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain automated backup solutions, including incremental snapshots and retention policies across cloud and on-premise systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and support disaster recovery (DR) and business continuity strategies, including failover planning, backup validation, and recovery testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and support virtualization platforms (Hyper-V, VMware), including clustering, replication, and high availability configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute virtualization migrations and infrastructure upgrades with minimal downtime&lt;/li&gt;
