&lt;li&gt;Utilize NetSuite and other business systems to prioritize customer orders and shipment schedules based on contractual commitments, need-by dates, production capacity, material readiness, export clearance requirements, and DPAS ratings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise engineering and operations teams on packaging design, transportation requirements, and compliance considerations for dangerous goods and controlled exports&lt;/li&gt;
