&lt;li&gt;2+ years in a quality, manufacturing, reliability, or design engineering role on electro-mechanical hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GD&amp;amp;T and hands-on metrology, including calipers, height gauges, CMM, and visual inspection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with electro-mechanical assembly processes, such as fastening and torque control, thread locking, connector mating, harness routing and strain relief, potting and staking, and adhesive bonding, and their common defect modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and Python, including querying production databases and analyzing manufacturing and test data&lt;/li&gt;
