&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on quality inspection or quality engineering experience in a manufacturing production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and work from engineering drawings, work instructions, and controlled documentation, including GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with precision measurement tools and inspection methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience documenting nonconformances and driving root cause and corrective action&lt;/li&gt;
