&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neros builds drones for the modern battlefield. As a Senior Software Engineer on our Application team, you will build the tools and integrations our operators and engineers rely on. Mission planning and control software, desktop tools, and the connections between our systems and external command &amp;amp; control and situational awareness systems. You&#39;ll own major pieces end to end, from design to production software that keeps working when the network drops or the systems around it change.&lt;/p&gt;
