&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application&lt;/strong&gt; experience — cross-platform desktop (Electron, Qt, or similar) or modern web shipped to real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid &lt;strong&gt;networking fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt; — TCP/UDP, message framing and serialization, and designing for unreliable or high-latency links&lt;/li&gt;
