&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working with USMC units, programs, or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency with unmanned systems or defense hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed to military bases and field locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills with military and civilian stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across sales, product, operations, and leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
